 "note": "Construction money at the opening year, renovations at the mid-construction year (work still under way at face value, shown in 2026), purchases at the purchase year. binding marks commitments that are signed, such as Oklahoma City's arena under construction.",
 "method": "select i.year, i.team, i.item_id, i.description, i.kind, case when i.kind = 'construction' then 'new' when i.kind = 'project' and i.team = 'UTA' then 'district' when i.kind = 'project' then 'new_unopened' else 'existing' end as category, case when i.core then 'counted' when i.status = 'pending' then 'pending' else 'committed' end as status, i.status = 'binding' as binding, i.public_2026_m, coalesce((select list(s.source_id order by s.ord) from item_sources s where s.item_id = i.item_id and s.role = 'public'), []) as sources from items i where i.kind <> 'ongoing' and i.public_2026_m > 0 order by i.year, category, i.team, i.item_id"
}
